AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001002> <https://ai4curation.github.io/aidocs/reference/clients/claude-code/>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001002> "exposure to emotional abuse")
