AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001003> "An exposure to childhood abuse and neglect in which the exposure stressor is emotional neglect of the exposure receptor.")
