# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001004> (exposure to physical neglect)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001004> "An exposure to childhood abuse and neglect in which the exposure stressor is physical neglect of the exposure receptor.")
