AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001004> "The fine-grained abuse/neglect siblings are asserted children of 'exposure to childhood abuse and neglect' (NCIT:C16424); NCIT carries only clinical-encounter codes for the specific concepts, so these are bespoke.")
