AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001005> "An exposure to visible light radiation at an intensity substantially above typical ambient levels, such as high-light stress conditions in plant biology.")
